    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah i get the sim swapping part. but what about the actual way they get in? like, once they have the code or the access, what's the typical 'profile' of these attackers? are we talking organized groups or just random people trying things out? i'm trying to shape the narrative for the partners about the 'threat landscape' we're facing.",
